[P_08_SeoulOne_Conv_Elite_Map]
Speech_-001L=(null)
Speech_0001L=NKElite_Li - Look. Here. We were here and we crossed the line to the south, here. That puts us in--
Speech_0002L=NKElite_Soo - No. We were in here... look. Then we crossed the line there.
Speech_0003L=NKElite_Li - No, see that's where you're confused.
Speech_0004L=NKElite_Soo - I know where we are. I was looking at the map while you were driving.
Speech_0005L=NKElite_Li - Well, you weren't looking very closely were you?
Speech_0006L=NKElite_Soo - Look, fine. You think you know where we are, you navigate. I'm gonna take a leak.
Speech_0007L=NKElite_Li - Don't get lost.
Speech_0008L=NKElite_Soo - Shove it.

[P_08_SeoulOne_Conv_Garden_Tech]
Speech_-001L=(null)
Speech_0001L=NKTech_Ming - Are you on-line in there now?
Speech_0002L=NKTech_Yong - Yes!
Speech_0003L=NKTech_Ming - Alright... I'm going to initiate the tests.
Speech_0004L=NKTech_Yong - Wait! Wait!
Speech_-001L=(null)
Speech_0005L=NKTech_Ming - What's the problem?
Speech_0006L=NKTech_Yong - Well... I'm a little worried... won't we be a giant flashing light on someone's scope once we start the tests?
Speech_0007L=NKTech_Ming - The Americans know where we are... if they haven't bombed us already, wither we've won this war, or they left us alive for a reason.
Speech_0008L=NKTech_Yong - Wow. I feel safer already.
Speech_0009L=NKTech_Ming - I'm going to start the tests.
Speech_0010L=NKTech_Yong - Alright.

[P_08_SeoulOne_Conv_NDT_C4]
Speech_-001L=(null)
Speech_0001L=NKSol_Bong - You think that's enough?
Speech_0002L=NKSol_Feng - I don't know. You're the demolitions expert. You tell me.
Speech_0003L=NKSol_Bong - Well, I guess it's enough.
Speech_0004L=NKSol_Feng - You guess? What if it's too much?
Speech_0005L=NKSol_Bong - Oh... I didn't even think of that...
Speech_0006L=NKSol_Feng - Well... you idiot. If we destroy the stuff inside, then what's the point?!
Speech_0007L=NKSol_Bong - No... no, I think it should be okay.
Speech_0008L=NKSol_Feng - You think?
Speech_0009L=NKSol_Bong - Yeah. It's fine. Let's do it. Let's blow it.
Speech_0010L=NKSol_Feng - Well, let's take cover first.
Speech_0011L=NKSol_Bong - Oh, yeah... good idea.
Speech_-001L=(null)
Speech_0012L=NKSol_Feng - Hey... there's a guy in there!
Speech_0013L=NKSol_Bong - What?
Speech_0014L=NKSol_Feng - Blow the door!
Speech_0015L=NKSol_Bong - What? What if it kills him?
Speech_0016L=NKSol_Feng - That's the point... blow it!
Speech_0017L=NKSol_Bong - Alright! Take cover, quick.
Speech_-001L=(null)
Speech_0018L=NKSol_Feng - What's going on in there?
Speech_0019L=NKSol_Bong - What? I didn't see anything.
Speech_0020L=NKSol_Feng - Well... let's just blow the damn door and take a closer look.
Speech_0021L=NKSol_Bong - Alright. Let's get behind cover.
Speech_-001L=(null)
Speech_0022L=NKSol_Feng - Blow the door!

[P_08_SeoulOne_Conv_NDT_Elevator]
Speech_-001L=(null)
Speech_0001L=NKSol_Kwan - ...nice view up there though.
Speech_0002L=NKSol_Sun - I'll say... there's something strangely... mesmerizing about anti-aircraft tracer fire lighting up the night sky.
Speech_0003L=NKSol_Kwan - Beautiful.
Speech_0004L=NKSol_Sun - Better than looking at boring old stars, that's for sure.
Speech_0005L=NKSol_Kwan - Ack-ack... kind of a do-it-yourself constellation kit.
Speech_0006L=NKSol_Sun - Yep. Well, I'm going to go check on Bong and Feng, see how it's coming with that door.
Speech_0007L=NKSol_Kwan - They probably blew themselves up.
Speech_0008L=NKSol_Sun - Ha...yeah... see ya later.
Speech_0009L=NKSol_Kwan - Later.

