[P_08_SeoulOne_HQcom]
Speech_-001L=(null)
Speech_0001L=LAMBERT - Welcome to the three-block war, FISHER. The main advance has bypassed your position, but expect sporadic fighting among units separated from the main force.
Speech_0002L=FISHER - Whose side am I on here?
Speech_0003L=LAMBERT - Your own. You are not a legal combatant. Anyone who sees you will attack on sight... friend or foe.
Speech_-001L=(null)
Speech_0005L=LAMBERT - FISHER, anything you can do to assist in the war effort would earn me a few brownie points down on Pennsylvania Avenue.
Speech_0006L=FISHER - I think I'll start with this annoying propaganda...
Speech_-001L=(null)
Speech_0007L=LAMBERT - Good thinking FISHER... shut down those propaganda broadcasts and our boys will be in better spirits.
Speech_0008L=FISHER - Our boys? I'm just doing it because it's annoying.
Speech_-001L=(null)
Speech_0045L=LAMBERT - Good job, FISHER. Taking down their psy-ops will make everyone happier.
Speech_-001L=(null)
Speech_0046L=LAMBERT - Good job, Sam. There is only one more propaganda broadcast set-up in your area.
Speech_0127L=(null)
Speech_0047L=LAMBERT - Way to go, FISHER. That's the last of their propaganda stations in this area.
Speech_0048L=FISHER - Thank god... I was starting to lose my mind.
Speech_0128L=(null)
Speech_0015L=LAMBERT - FISHER... critical update... I have other assets on the ground, not far from your position.
Speech_0016L=FISHER - Another Splinter Cell?
Speech_0051L=LAMBERT - Splinter Cells in training. They're on a black bag op, but their target was just relocated by NKA Special Forces.
Speech_0052L=FISHER - So I need to bring in the target?
Speech_0053L=LAMBERT - No. You need to interrogate one of those Special Forces to find out where they took him.
Speech_0054L=FISHER - Okay.
Speech_0055L=LAMBERT - Don't kill them before you talk to them or I'll pull you out.
Speech_-001L=(null)
Speech_0056L=FISHER - You want to tell me what's going on LAMBERT?
Speech_0017L=LAMBERT - Sorry, FISHER... but you're getting too old for this kind of work.
Speech_0057L=FISHER - Stop listening to Grim. If you go by her definition of old you'd need to issue diapers with every set of goggles.
Speech_0058L=LAMBERT - If I listen to you much longer it'll be adult undergarments.
Speech_0059L=FISHER - That was cruel.
Speech_-001L=(null)
Speech_0060L=LAMBERT - Dammit, Sam, you needed to interrogate one of those men. The mission is over.
Speech_0129L=(null)
Speech_0021L=LAMBERT - FISHER, don't bother to wait for the elevator, you need to grab the drives out of the NDT before you go to the roof to transmit.
Speech_-001L=(null)
Speech_0061L=LAMBERT - Next stop, top floor.
Speech_0062L=FISHER - Once I transmit the data, I'm on to extraction?
Speech_0063L=LAMBERT - That's the plan. If we can confirm the LZ is safe, we'll extract you directly from the rooftop.
Speech_0064L=FISHER - And if it's not safe...
Speech_-001L=(null)
Speech_0065L=GRIMSDOTTIR - Sam, a Predator drone just spotted a Mobile Command Center in the area up ahead. See if you can tap it for intelligence.
Speech_0066L=FISHER - You don't want me to take it out?
Speech_0126L=GRIMSDOTTIR - No... we could have done that with the Predator.
Speech_0130L=(null)
Speech_0068L=GRIMSDOTTIR - Good job, Sam. With an inside line on the NKA's command network we should be able to funnel useful intelligence to the reg's.
Speech_0069L=FISHER - Always happy to lend a hand.
Speech_-001L=(null)
Speech_0100L=GRIMSDOTTIR - FISHER, those are the main servers for the National Data Trunk every bit of data that moves through here gets tagged in transit.
Speech_0101L=FISHER - It's smaller than I thought.
Speech_0102L=GRIMSDOTTIR - And getting smaller every year. Listen, you need to recover the main drives so I can see if the attack that launched the missile came from somewhere else first.
Speech_0131L=(null)
Speech_0104L=GRIMSDOTTIR - Good. Now get that drive up to the roof and we'll transmit it to the EA-6B.
Speech_0105L=FISHER - Why can't you just read it from here?
Speech_0106L=GRIMSDOTTIR - It will take too long to guarantee a secure link, and if the DPRK intercepts it
Speech_0107L=FISHER - Then this mission is a waste of time.
Speech_0132L=(null)
Speech_0108L=REDDING - Listen, there aren't any alarms to worry about, but anyone you encounter will probably already be alert.
Speech_0109L=FISHER - I'll be careful.
Speech_0110L=REDDING - You have a lot of ground to cover, Sam, watch out for booby-traps.
Speech_0111L=FISHER - I memorized the Field Manual before you were even born, Will.

[P_08_SeoulOne_HQCom_Summaries]
Speech_-001L=(null)
Speech_0001L=LAMBERT - FISHER, try and disable their propaganda broadcasts.
Speech_-001L=(null)
Speech_0002L=LAMBERT - Good work Sam. That's the last propaganda broadcast point.
Speech_-001L=(null)
Speech_0003L=LAMBERT - FISHER, you need to interrogate one of the Special Forces troops to find out where they left their passenger.
Speech_-001L=(null)
Speech_0004L=LAMBERT - FISHER, you need to grab the drives out of the NDT before you go to the roof to transmit.
Speech_-001L=(null)
Speech_0006L=GRIMSDOTTIR - Good job, Sam. With an inside line on the NKA's command network we should be able to funnel useful intelligence to the reg's.
Speech_-001L=(null)
Speech_0010L=GRIMSDOTTIR - Good work Sam. Take the drive up the roof so we can transmit the data to the EA-6B.
Speech_-001L=(null)
Speech_0011L=REDDING - There won't be any alarms to worry about... everyone is already alert... but keep your eyes peeled for booby-traps and mines.

[P_08_SeoulOne_Interro_Elite]
Speech_-001L=(null)
Speech_0026L=FISHER - Stay quiet and you might live.
Speech_0027L=NKElite_Soo - Wh! Who?
Speech_0131L=FISHER - Shut it... LAMBERT... I've got one.
Speech_0132L=LAMBERT - Good job FISHER, I'm going to patch you through direct... hold on.
Speech_0029L=FISHER - Stay calm... this'll just take a sec.
Speech_0030L=NKElite_Soo - Oh... okay...
Speech_0133L=LAMBERT - Alright, FISHER, go ahead...
Speech_0134L=FISHER - I've got someone who wants to talk to you...
Speech_0135L=MP_One - Roger... ask him where they took Jong.
Speech_0034L=FISHER - Where did you take Jong?
Speech_0035L=NKElite_Soo - I... I don't know what you're talking about...
Speech_0136L=FISHER - He's not answering... should I kill him?
Speech_0137L=MP_One - Negative! Negative!
Speech_0038L=FISHER - Alright... they say I should kill you, so--
Speech_0039L=NKElite_Soo - Wait... okay... Jong... we moved him to a cyber café just off the fish market by the river.
Speech_0138L=FISHER - Is that what you needed to know guys?
Speech_0139L=MP_One - Ah... affirmative... thanks a lot, sir. We owe you one.
Speech_0140L=FISHER - Welcome to the team.
Speech_-001L=(null)
Speech_0141L=FISHER - Shut it... LAMBERT... I've got one.
Speech_0142L=LAMBERT - Alright, FISHER, go ahead...
