Speech_0144L=NKElite_Soo - Wait... okay... Jong... we moved him to a cyber café just off the fish market by the river.
Speech_0129L=NKElit_Soo - Now what are you going to do?
Speech_0130L=NKElit_Soo - I don't know anything else.
