[P_08_SeoulOne_Interro_Garden_Sol]
Speech_-001L=(null)
Speech_0001L=FISHER - What's with the truck?
Speech_0002L=NKSol_Chin - Oh... damn... It's a Mobile Command Center... for battlefield management.
Speech_0003L=FISHER - It's tied into the NKA central networks?
Speech_0004L=NKSol_Chin - Yeah...
Speech_0005L=FISHER - I bet a curious guy could get a lot of useful intelligence out of one of those....
Speech_0006L=NKSol_Chin - You didn't hear it from me.
Speech_0008L=NKSol_Chin - We have orders to protect the MCC... but... I'm on a break.

[P_08_SeoulOne_Interro_Garden_Tech]
Speech_-001L=(null)
Speech_0001L=FISHER - Nice truck...
Speech_0002L=NKTech_Ming - Ah... ulp... it's... it's not mine...
Speech_0003L=FISHER - So you probably won't mind if I access it for a second?
Speech_0004L=NKTech_Ming - Well... I won't mind as long as you don't kill me.
Speech_0005L=FISHER - I'll think about it.
Speech_0012L=NKTech_Ming - Please... I don't want to die for a stupid truck...
Speech_0013L=NKTech_Ming - I'm just a stupid technician...

[P_08_SeoulOne_Interro_NDT_C4_Sol]
Speech_-001L=(null)
Speech_0001L=FISHER - Shhh... quiet or I'll have to hurt you...
Speech_0002L=NKSol_Bong - Oh, no.
Speech_0003L=FISHER - What is your mission?
Speech_0004L=NKSol_Bong - We're here to secure the structure and tap into the South Korean National Data Trunk.
Speech_0005L=FISHER - What are you looking for?
Speech_0006L=NKSol_Bong - As far as I know... nothing specific... but... since you're here... maybe we'd like to look for whatever you're looking for...
Speech_0007L=FISHER - I guess I'll have to make sure no one knows you saw me.
Speech_0008L=NKSol_Bong - Oh... god... please don't kill me.
Speech_0009L=NKSol_Bong - I'll give you all my money... please.
Speech_0010L=NKSol_Bong - I feel sick...

