[P_08_SeoulOne_NK_Propaganda]
Speech_0001L=Democratic Party Korean Sibling! Observe your American guardian flee as butter-fattened ducks steamed for the slaughter! Refuse their fraudulent escapists! Embrace us your truth one liberators!
Speech_0002L=Our Democratic Party Army is your sibling Korean Army! The oppressor is your lazy American demon. Us and freedom, combine the life which is peaceful and eternal, united together forever!
Speech_0003L=Korean Sibling! Our combined enemy is the lard-mongering American person. By the effort which combines us, we shall them repulse from our homeland! Give them gifts of humiliating defeat and death most miserable!
Speech_0004L=American persons is the drunkard of the media deceits! Search your Northern part sibling and be opened and combine. The shackles of the pressure make we burn the West together in ten possibilities of the lock!

[P_08_SeoulOne_NK_Snippets]
Speech_0001L=O'DELL - Meanwhile, as the first horrifying numbers for this tragic conflict being to roll in, Americans are asking, 'How did this happen'. It's a question we'll ask of Secretary of Defense Frank Mason, tonight on WNM Flash when White House correspondent Montgomery Lewis sits down with the Secretary to talk about the war, the contracting scandal, and his alleged affair with Air Force Major Veronique Guilbault.
Speech_0002L=O'DELL - In sports news, New York pitcher Akira Watanabe formally requested exemption from his contract with his new team. The world's highest paid baseball player has announced his intention to return to his country to join the Japanese Self Defense Force to - quote - help defend his people, his land, and his culture from the Korean aggressors.

[P_08_SeoulOne_Objectives]
Objective_0001=Locate and retrieve data drives from the NDT
Objective_0016=The National Data Trunk surfaces at a switching station in central Seoul. Recover the drives from the station to discover if the attack on the Walsh originated in South Korea.
Objective_0004=Stop the North Korean Propaganda Broadcasts
Objective_0017=Disabling loud speakers broadcasting North Korean propaganda would dramatically improve the morale of allied troops.
Objective_0011=Get to the rooftop to transfer the data to the EA-6B
Objective_0018=Broadcast the data from the NDT drives from the roof of the building to an EA-6B using a point-to-point secure laser communication link to prevent data interception.
Objective_0006=Interrogate a Special Forces agent to determine the location of Jong
Objective_0019=Third Echelon operatives operating elsewhere in Seoul need you to interrogate nearby Special Forces. The mission will be aborted if they die before interrogation.
Objective_0012=Exfiltrate to the primary extraction point
Objective_0020=(null)
Objective_0013=Exfiltrate to any available extraction point
Objective_0021=(null)
Objective_0015=Tap a Mobile Command Center
Objective_0022=Enter and tap a North Korean MCC to give Third Echelon access to the North Korean command networks.

[P_08_SeoulOne_Player_Notes]
Note_0001L=The data drives are located in the switching room of the NDT building.
Note_0002L=Watch out for innocent looking booby traps
Note_0003L=Medical supplies are located in the washroom of the NDT building
Note_0004L=The only way to the roof of the building is via the elevator
Note_0005L=The key code for the switching room doors is 0815

