[P_08_SeoulOne_SRC_Astronauts]
Speech_-001L=(null)
Speech_0001L=NKSol_A - Did you hear?
Speech_0002L=NKSol_B - What?
Speech_0003L=NKSol_A - Our fierce and noble Chinese brothers have stood up to the American oppressors!
Speech_0004L=NKSol_B - You mean... they have entered the war!?
Speech_0005L=NKSol_A - Oh... no... not that...
Speech_0006L=NKSol_B - What do you mean?
Speech_0009L=NKSol_A - They are launching their rocket... they are sending a proud Taikonaut to rescue the astronauts on the ISS despite NASA's refusal to accept their generous offer.
Speech_0007L=NKSol_B - Why would they want to help the Americans?
Speech_0008L=NKSol_A - To prove their greatness! It takes strength to show mercy for your enemy! It is most humiliating to the American dogs!

[P_08_SeoulOne_SRC_Seoul]
Speech_-001L=(null)
Speech_0001L=NKSol_E - You know what I can't figure out?
Speech_0002L=NKSol_F - What?
Speech_0003L=NKSol_E - Well, all the stuff they tell us about how the South Koreans are living in filth... eating dogs on the street... how they are lackeys and slaves to fat Americans...
Speech_0004L=NKSol_F - Yes?
Speech_0005L=NKSol_E - Well... take a look around...
Speech_0006L=NKSol_F - What do you mean?
Speech_0007L=NKSol_E - Well... even bombed to pieces... this place looks a lot nicer than where I live...
Speech_0008L=NKSol_F - What you're saying is dangerously close to treason. They can hang you for that.
Speech_0009L=NKSol_E - That's exactly what I mean.

